# error: 13:9: write `it.qty > 3`, or `not (it.qty <= 3)`
# error: 16:9: write `a != 2`, or `not (a == 2)`
# error: 17:9: write `b == 1.5`, or `not (b != 1.5)`
# error: 20:9: write `not (it.price < 2.5)`: `not` applies to the whole comparison
# error: 23:9: write `it.name < "m"`, or `not (it.name >= "m")`
# error: 26:6: write `a <= 1`, or `not (a > 1)`
# error: 28:14: write `a >= 0`, or `not (a < 0)`
# error: 30:21: write `(a) <= (2)`, or `not ((a) > (2))`
# error: 33:13: write `a != 1`, or `not (a == 1)`
